[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/comments/3544394553","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/3830#issuecomment-3544394553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/3830","id":3544394553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFy3KIc7TQys5","user":{"login":"YuanTingHsieh","id":13113932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTEzOTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13113932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh","html_url":"https://github.com/YuanTingHsieh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T00:03:03Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T00:03:03Z","body":"Hi @SlamanigG\n\nI observed the same behavior using NVFLARE 2.5 with Flower 1.11.0.\n\nThe newer NVFLARE versions (2.6 and 2.7) are designed to work with Flower 1.23.0.\n\nFor NVFLARE 2.5, we needed to add the following lines:\n\n```\ndiff --git a/nvflare/app_common/tie/executor.py b/nvflare/app_common/tie/executor.py\nindex f40bca989..d86ebc4f9 100644\n--- a/nvflare/app_common/tie/executor.py\n+++ b/nvflare/app_common/tie/executor.py\n@@ -138,6 +138,9 @@ class TieExecutor(Executor):\n             self._notify_client_done(Constant.EXIT_CODE_FATAL_ERROR, fl_ctx)\n         elif event_type == EventType.END_RUN:\n             self.abort_signal.trigger(True)\n+            if self.connector:\n+                self.logger.info(f\"stopping connector {type(self.connector)}\")\n+                self.connector.stop(fl_ctx)\n \n     def execute(self, task_name: str, shareable: Shareable, fl_ctx: FLContext, abort_signal: Signal) -> Shareable:\n         if task_name == self.configure_task_name:\n```\n\nThis fix is already included in NVFLARE 2.6 and later.\n\nWe recommend trying the newer versions if possible. Otherwise, you can manually apply this change to 2.5.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/comments/3544394553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/comments/3563405701","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/3830#issuecomment-3563405701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/3830","id":3563405701,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFy3KIc7UZUGF","user":{"login":"holgerroth","id":6304754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDQ3NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6304754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth","html_url":"https://github.com/holgerroth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holgerroth/receiv